<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Welcome to Errandy</title>
    <style>
      @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');

      body {
        font-family:
          'Inter',
          -apple-system,
          BlinkMacSystemFont,
          'Segoe UI',
          Roboto,
          sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #374151;
        background-color: #f3f4f6;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #f3f4f6;
        padding: 40px 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow:
          0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
          0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      }

      .header {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 32px 20px;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
      }

      .logo {
        height: 40px;
        width: auto;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 40px 32px;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #111827;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      p {
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        color: #4b5563;
      }

      .hero-text {
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .feature-grid {
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .feature-item {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .feature-item:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .feature-icon {
        font-size: 20px;
        margin-right: 12px;
        min-width: 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .feature-content strong {
        display: block;
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .feature-content span {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #6b7280;
      }

      .cta-section {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 100%);
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 16px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      .next-steps {
        border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
        padding-top: 32px;
      }

      .step-title {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        display: block;
      }

      .footer {
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        padding: 32px 20px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      }

      .footer p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #9ca3af;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .footer a {
        color: #6b7280;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='wrapper'>
      <div class='container'>
        <div class='header'>
          <img
            src='https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/errandy-480815.firebasestorage.app/o/logo.png?alt=media&token=e1ffc278-42e2-43e1-a79d-84f2345bf620'
            alt='Errandy'
            class='logo'
          />
        </div>

        <div class='content'>
          <h1>Welcome to Errandy! 🎉</h1>

          <p class='hero-text'>Hi
            {{name}}, we're thrilled to have you on board! Errandy is your new
            go-to platform for getting things done.</p>

          <div class='feature-grid'>
            <div class='feature-item'>
              <span class='feature-icon'>🚀</span>
              <div class='feature-content'>
                <strong>Post Errands Easily</strong>
                <span>Describe what you need, set your budget, and let us handle
                  the rest.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class='feature-item'>
              <span class='feature-icon'>🛡️</span>
              <div class='feature-content'>
                <strong>Trusted & Verified</strong>
                <span>Connect with vetted providers you can rely on for quality
                  service.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class='feature-item'>
              <span class='feature-icon'>💳</span>
              <div class='feature-content'>
                <strong>Secure Payments</strong>
                <span>Funds are held safely until you're 100% satisfied with the
                  work.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='next-steps'>
            <span class='step-title'>Here is what you can do next:</span>
            <p>Complete your profile to build trust with the community, explore
              available services, or post your very first errand today!</p>
          </div>

          <div class='cta-section'>
            <a href='https://errandy.app' class='button'>Get Started Now</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='footer'>
          <p>&copy; {{year}} Errandy. All rights reserved.</p>
          <p>Lagos, Nigeria</p>
          <p>
            <a href='{{unsubscribeUrl}}'>Unsubscribe</a>
            •
            <a href='https://errandy.app/privacy'>Privacy Policy</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>